**Context**: 7-slide data analysis deck on "The 2025 LLM Usage Landscape: Real-World Data from OpenRouter" for LLM industry professionals (R&D, product, investment). Tone: data-forward, engaging, professional.

**Design System**:
- Palette (use ONLY these colors, NO # prefix):
  - theme.primary = "264653" (dark teal - backgrounds/titles)
  - theme.secondary = "2a9d8f" (medium teal - accents)
  - theme.accent = "e9c46a" (yellow - highlights)
  - theme.light = "f4a261" (orange - light accent)
  - theme.bg = "f2f7f5" (off-white background)
- Font: Calibri for all text
- Style: Sharp & Compact (rectRadius: 0, tight spacing)
- Slide dimensions: 10" x 5.625" (LAYOUT_16x9)
- NO gradients, NO animations, NO # in hex colors

**Slide Content** (Cover Page - Asymmetric Left-Right Layout):
- Left side (dark teal background panel): 
  - Main title (large): "The 2025 LLM Usage Landscape"
  - Subtitle: "Real-World Data from OpenRouter"
  - Data source note: "Source: OpenRouter Rankings • Latest week of March 2025"
- Right side (off-white or light background):
  - Headline metric callout: "26T+" tokens (very large number)
  - Label below: "Weekly Tokens Processed"
  - A secondary stat: "10 Providers" 
  - Label: "Competing for Market Share"
  - Date/occasion: "March 2025"

**Critical Rules**:
- NO page number badge on cover slide
- NO # prefix in hex colors (e.g., use "264653" not "#264653")
- NO async/await in createSlide()
- NO reusing option objects across calls
- File saves to `/app/slides/slide-01.js`
- Working directory for standalone preview: `/app/slides/`

**File format**:
```javascript
const pptxgen = require("pptxgenjs");
const slideConfig = { type: 'cover', index: 1, title: 'The 2025 LLM Usage Landscape: Real-World Data from OpenRouter' };

function createSlide(pres, theme) {
  const slide = pres.addSlide();
  // ... all drawing code here
  return slide;
}

if (require.main === module) {
  const pres = new pptxgen();
  pres.layout = 'LAYOUT_16x9';
  const theme = { primary: "264653", secondary: "2a9d8f", accent: "e9c46a", light: "f4a261", bg: "f2f7f5" };
  createSlide(pres, theme);
  pres.writeFile({ fileName: "/app/slides/slide-01-preview.pptx" });
}
module.exports = { createSlide, slideConfig };
```

Write the complete file now. Make it visually impactful with the asymmetric layout - left panel in dark teal (x:0, y:0, w:5.5, h:5.625), right panel lighter. Use large stat callouts (60-72pt) for the numbers on the right. Title should be 48-56pt on the dark panel in white/accent color text.

